 evaluates it. You bill the injection and an office visit. The payer denies the office visit as bundled into the procedure — because by default it assumes any visit on the day of a procedure is part of that procedure."}],"$L1a"]}],"$L1b","$L1c","$L1d","$L1e","$L1f","$L20"]}]]}]]}]}]]}],false,false,"$L21",false,"$undefined","$L22","$L23"]}]
